
Usage:
  Options [OPTION...]

  -h, --help                  Show help message
      --timeout-sec arg       The timeout to wait for the 
                              nvidia-nsight-perf service to be ready 
                              (seconds) (default: 60)
      --ignore provider_type  Ignore a provider when checking service 
                              readiness. Ignorable provider types: gpu_pm, 
                              gpu_hwt. Ex: --ignore gpu_pm,gpu_hwt

